"notes": [], "prompt_version": "translator-v2", "publication_status": "CANDIDATE", "qa_status": "PASS", "reasoning_effort": "high", "run_id": "run-etale-cohomology59-gpt61sol-p098-20261111", "schema_version": 2, "source_adoption_id": "etale-cohomology59-gpt61sol-p098-20261111", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_text_hash": "sha256:2ba129a78db89531d64b958a8f57451719b605e6d227cd61f28e1653cab7969d", "stage": "STRUCTURE_OK", "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "<ACCENT_0001>tale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "functoriality", "target_term": "函子性"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "small", "target_term": "小"}, {"source_term": "<ACCENT_0002>tale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "sites", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "final object", "target_term": "终对象"}, {"source_term": "final object", "target_term": "终对象"}, {"source_term": "fibre products", "target_term": "纤维积"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "morphism of sites", "target_term": "景的态射"}, {"source_term": "Sites", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "Sites", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "<ACCENT_0003>tale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "<ACCENT_0004>tale cohomology", "target_term": "平展上同调"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "pushforward", "target_term": "前推"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"source_term": "<ACCENT_0005>tale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n迄今我们尚未讨论平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）景（site）的函子性（functoriality），换言之，给定概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）时会发生什么。精确的形式讨论见《拓扑（Topologies）》第<REF_0001>节。本节和随后几节将专门在小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）景（sites）的情形下简要讨论这些内容。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n设<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。我们得到函子（functor）<MATH_0002>。这个函子（functor）有以下重要性质<STRUCT_0004>\n<STRUCT_0005><MATHSEG_0001>终对象（final object）<MATHSEG_0002>终对象（final object）<MATHSEG_0003>，\n<STRUCT_0006><MATH_0003>保持纤维积（fibre products），\n<STRUCT_0007>若<MATH_0004>是<MATH_0005>中的覆盖（covering），则<MATH_0006>是<MATH_0007>中的覆盖（covering）。\n<STRUCT_0008>\n这些性质都容易验证（略）。由此我们得到所谓的<TEXTITOPEN_0001>景的态射（morphism of sites）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001><MATH_0008>，见《景（Sites）》定义<REF_0002>及《景（Sites）》命题<REF_0003>。使用平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale）层（sheaves）及平展上同调（<ACCENT_0004>tale cohomology）时，无须详细了解这个抽象概念。通常只需知道有函子（functors）<MATH_0009>（前推（pushforward））和<MATH_0010>（拉回（pullback））作用于平展（<ACCENT_0005>tale）层（sheaves），并了解它们的一些简单性质。我们将在随后几节讨论这些性质，但有时会引用更抽象的材料来给出证明，因为那里往往是证明这些性质的自然情境。\n\n\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:58d89427df99f891aea84fb4930d4bf67a32db39082fdd5e84e6ed7f6f31448b", "unit_id": "tag:04I0:prose-0001", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "平展景的函子性。", "source_term": "<ACCENT_0001>tale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"context": "平展景。", "source_term": "site", "target_term": "景"}, {"context": "概形态射所引出的函子性。", "source_term": "functoriality", "target_term": "函子性"}, {"context": "给定的概形。", "source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"context": "概形的态射。", "source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "引用章名。", "source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"context": "小平展景。", "source_term": "small", "target_term": "小"}, {"context": "小平展景。", "source_term": "<ACCENT_0002>tale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"context": "小平展景。", "source_term": "sites", "target_term": "景"}, {"context": "态射引出的函子。", "source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"context": "函子对终对象的作用。", "source_term": "final object", "target_term": "终对象"}, {"context": "函子保持纤维积。", "source_term": "fibre products", "target_term": "纤维积"}, {"context": "函子保持覆盖。", "source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"context": "由所述性质得到的景态射。", "source_term": "morphism of sites", "target_term": "景的态射"}, {"context": "引用章名。", "source_term": "Sites", "target_term": "景"}, {"context": "平展层。", "source_term": "<ACCENT_0003>tale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"context": "平展层。", "source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"context": "平展上同调。", "source_term": "<ACCENT_0004>tale cohomology", "target_term": "平展上同调"}, {"context": "函子的层类别。", "source_term": "<ACCENT_0005>tale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"context": "前推和拉回函子。", "source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}, {"context": "层的前推。", "source_term": "pushforward", "target_term": "前推"}, {"context": "层的拉回。", "source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回"}]}
